{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"agent_message","text":"The new app now builds cleanly with a modern Next.js stack. The implementation includes:\n\n- a responsive editorial storefront that keeps the live-millisecond preview and fitted/unisex choices;\n- Stripe Checkout with server-side price enforcement, shipping collection, metadata, success/cancel states, and signed webhook handling;\n- a Prodigi sandbox order handoff using the verified `GLOBAL-TEE-BC-3001` Bella+Canvas SKU;\n- a server-generated PNG artwork endpoint so Prodigi can fetch the exact frozen timestamp as a public print asset.\n\nI’m moving to deployment and wiring the sandbox credentials next."}}
