{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"The deployment is live, and the server-side checkout endpoint is already returning a real Stripe test Checkout Session. I also registered a test-mode Stripe webhook endpoint for the production URL and stored its signing secret in Vercel. Next I’m exercising the signed webhook with a sandbox-only completion payload to validate the Prodigi handoff without charging a customer or creating a real fulfillment order."}}
